#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:359
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattleArena"
msgid ""
"Where the battling spirit of TRAINERS\n"
"is put to the test!\p"
"I welcome you to the BATTLE ARENA!\p"
"I am your guide to the Set KO Tourney!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:365
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_WishToTakeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Now, do you wish to take\n"
"the BATTLE ARENA challenge?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:369
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_AwaitAnotherChallenge"
msgid ""
"We await your challenge on\n"
"another occasion!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:373
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ExplainChallenge"
msgid ""
"In the BATTLE ARENA, we undertake\n"
"the Set KO Tourney.\p"
"All participants enter with a team of\n"
"three POKéMON.\p"
"The three POKéMON must be lined up in\n"
"the order in which they are to appear.\p"
"During battle, the POKéMON will appear\n"
"one at a time in the preset order.\p"
"Once a POKéMON enters battle, it must\n"
"remain out until the match is decided.\p"
"If a match remains undecided in\n"
"three turns, it goes to judging.\p"
"If you wish to interrupt your challenge,\n"
"please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save, you will not be able\n"
"to continue with your challenge.\p"
"If you pull off the feat of beating\n"
"seven TRAINERS in succession,\l"
"we will present you with Battle Points.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:394
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_OkayToSave"
msgid ""
"Before showing you to the BATTLE\n"
"ARENA, you must save. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:398
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE ARENA offers two levels\n"
"of challenge, Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which is your choice?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:403
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_SelectThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Very well, now select your\n"
"three POKéMON, please.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:407
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for entry.\p"
"To qualify, you must bring three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"They also must not hold the same\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:417
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsEnd"
msgid ""
"When you have made your preparations,\n"
"please do return.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:421
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for entry.\p"
"To qualify, you must bring three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"The three different POKéMON\n"
"must all be Level 50 or lower.\p"
"They also must not hold the same\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:433
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_GuideYouToArena"
msgid ""
"I shall now guide you to\n"
"the BATTLE ARENA.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:437
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_DidntSaveBeforeShuttingDown"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You did not save the game before\n"
"shutting down, did you?\p"
"It is unfortunate, but that has\n"
"resulted in your disqualification\l"
"from your challenge.\p"
"You may, of course, start with a fresh\n"
"challenge.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:447
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_CongratsOnSevenWins"
msgid ""
"We congratulate you for your splendid\n"
"string of wins over seven TRAINERS!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:451
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_RecordAchievement"
msgid ""
"Your achievement will be recorded.\n"
"Please wait while I save the game.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:456
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_PresentYouWithPrize"
msgid ""
"In commemoration of your 7-win streak,\n"
"we present you with this prize.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:461
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ReceivedPrize"
