msgid ""
"We have been looking forward to\n"
"your arrival.\p"
"Before I show you to the BATTLE\n"
"ARENA, I must save the game.\l"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:487
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_RecordLastMatch"
msgid ""
"Shall I record your last BATTLE ARENA\n"
"match on your FRONTIER PASS?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:491
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_BadIdeaToNotAttack"
msgid ""
"I lost on the REFEREE's decision…\p"
"I don't think it was a good idea to only\n"
"use defensive moves and not attack…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:496
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_LandingHitsWorked"
msgid ""
"I won in judging!\p"
"Landing hits consistently on\n"
"the opponent's POKéMON worked!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:501
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_MatchWasDeclaredDraw"
msgid ""
"Our match was declared a draw.\p"
"When we ran out of time, both my\n"
"POKéMON and the opponent's had about\l"
"the same amount of HP left.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:507
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_OrderOfMonsImportant"
msgid ""
"In the BATTLE ARENA, the order of\n"
"POKéMON is totally important.\p"
"For example, if your first POKéMON\n"
"has certain type disadvantages,\l"
"try making your second POKéMON one\l"
"with moves that are super effective\l"
"against the first one.\p"
"I think that will be a good way of\n"
"making an effective team.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:518
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid "The Set KO Tourney's rules are listed.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:521
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
